msgid "H743 Flash maintenance from a private RAM execution pod"
msgstr "从私有 RAM 执行区维护 H743 Flash"

msgid ""
"This page specifies the **target IO-24 design** for synchronous program and "
"erase operations on the selected STM32H743ZIT6 V/cache-off software "
"reference. It explains the private execution boundary, retained ownership "
"and the proof required before returning to ordinary Flash code. This "
"development batch has connected selected-only RAM code, a generated "
"workspace, the CPU bridge and the MPU transaction to the ordinary provider. "
"Actual production-ELF closure and the complete software exit remain open. "
"The figures retain their **target** identity until their implementation and "
"evidence exits are satisfied. Physical HIL is `not_executed`."
msgstr ""
"本页规定选定 STM32H743ZIT6 V 修订／Cache off 软件参考配置中同步编程和擦除的 **IO-24 "
"目标设计**，说明私有执行边界、保留的所有权，以及返回普通 Flash 代码前必须取得的证明。本开发批已将按需 RAM 代码、生成工作区、CPU "
"bridge 与 MPU 事务接入普通 provider。实际生产 ELF 闭包与完整软件退出仍未完成；图示在其实现和证据退出条件满足前保留 "
"**target** 身份。物理 HIL 为 `not_executed`。"

msgid ""
"The public Flash face still exposes physical geometry and synchronous "
"operations. The selected provider now requires cold RAM preparation; it has "
"no fallback that executes a physical pulse through the former ordinary "
"Flash-resident path. Existing image/control-alias guards, programming timing"
" and clock ownership remain prerequisites. Source integration or a "
"successful link alone cannot establish the entire IO-24 exit."
msgstr ""
"公共 Flash face 仍暴露物理几何与同步操作。选定 provider 现在要求冷态 RAM 准备；不再回退到原普通 Flash "
"驻留路径执行物理脉冲。已有镜像／控制别名保护、编程时序和时钟所有权仍是前提。源代码接入或链接成功本身不能建立整个 IO-24 退出。"

msgid ""
"Flash admission requires V revision `0x2003` for every selected Flash "
"profile, including fixed HSI32/64 and HSI64/PLL384; unknown cuts are "
"rejected. This restriction and the selected RAM workspace do not extend to "
"the other peripheral providers or to assemblies without Flash. Their "
"existing profile contracts remain authoritative."
msgstr ""
"所有选定 Flash 配置均要求 V 修订 `0x2003`，包括固定 HSI32/64 和 HSI64/PLL384；未知 cut "
"被拒绝。该限制和选定 RAM 工作区不扩展到其他外设 provider 或未选 Flash 的装配；它们仍以各自现有配置合同为准。"

msgid "Keep one controller owner and a cold factory"
msgstr "保持单一控制器 owner 与冷态 factory"

msgid ""
"![FIG-17 target: static face lookup and explicit preparation are separate "
"from the direct runtime call; the private RAM boundary owns CPU protection "
"and Flash settlement](../assets/diagrams/h743-flash-ram-architecture.svg)"
msgstr ""
"![FIG-17 target：静态 face 查找与显式准备独立于直接运行调用；私有 RAM 边界拥有 CPU 保护和 Flash "
"结清责任](../assets/diagrams/h743-flash-ram-architecture.svg)"

msgid ""
"FIG-17 target: static face lookup and explicit preparation are separate from"
" the direct runtime call; the private RAM boundary owns CPU protection and "
"Flash settlement"
msgstr "FIG-17 target：静态 face 查找与显式准备独立于直接运行调用；私有 RAM 边界拥有 CPU 保护和 Flash 结清责任"

msgid ""
"FIG-17 is the **target** architecture and its required ownership boundary; "
"it does not claim that all implementation and production-ELF exits have "
"passed. Solid arrows describe the explicitly labelled lookup, call or copy "
"relationship. The dashed external precondition is a caller responsibility, "
"not a platform task. The factory returns an existing immutable Flash face; "
"it performs no MMIO, allocation, execution-pod copy or maintenance. Once "
"acquired, ordinary I/O enters the selected private provider through the "
"face's shared read-only operations."
msgstr ""
"FIG-17 表示 **target** 架构及所需所有权边界，不宣称全部实现和生产 ELF "
"退出已通过。实线表示其标签明确说明的查找、调用或复制关系；虚线外部前提由调用者负责，不是平台任务。factory 返回既有不可变 Flash "
"face，不执行 MMIO、分配、执行区复制或维护。取得 face 后，普通 I/O 通过其共享只读操作表直接进入选定私有 provider。"

msgid "Owner"
msgstr "所有者"

msgid "Responsibility in the target design"
msgstr "目标设计中的责任"

msgid "Generated Platform lifecycle"
msgstr "生成的 Platform 生命周期"

msgid ""
"Select only the required private workspace and code; order preparation and "
"reverse cleanup; retain failed cleanup responsibility"
msgstr "仅选入所需私有工作区与代码；安排准备与逆序清理；保留清理失败责任"

msgid "H743 Flash provider"
msgstr "H743 Flash provider"

msgid ""
"Validate the physical operation, region, source and destination; stage "
"command/input for the single execution owner"
msgstr "校验物理操作、区域、源与目标；为单一执行 owner 暂存命令／输入"

msgid "Private RAM owner and bridge"
msgstr "私有 RAM owner 与 bridge"

msgid ""
"Prove copy/layout/context, install a private stack and RAM vectors, preserve"
" CPU state and keep the entire busy transaction in RAM"
msgstr "证明复制／布局／上下文，安装私有栈与 RAM 向量，保存 CPU 状态并使整个忙事务留在 RAM"

msgid "Private MPU guard"
msgstr "私有 MPU guard"

msgid ""
"Temporarily own the selector, selected descriptor and control changes; prove"
" installation and exact restoration"
msgstr "暂时拥有 selector、选定描述符与控制修改；证明安装及精确恢复"

msgid "Existing System"
msgstr "既有 System"

msgid ""
"Own the monotonic TIM2 domain and epoch; RAM maintenance must preserve that "
"contract"
msgstr "拥有单调 TIM2 时间域与 epoch；RAM 维护必须保持该合同"

msgid "External maintenance caller"
msgstr "外部维护调用者"

msgid ""
"Serialize calls as the single execution owner; quiesce and join other bus "
"masters and users, provide freshly erased consumer regions and choose "
"watchdog/recovery policy"
msgstr ""
"作为单一执行 owner 串行调度调用；撤回并 join 其他总线 master 与使用者，提供已证明新擦除的消费区域，并选择看门狗／恢复策略"

msgid ""
"There is no second Flash owner, runtime registry, heap, mandatory OS lock, "
"hidden worker or automatic watchdog feed. Application tasks, update policy, "
"partitions, authentication and reset policy remain in external repositories."
msgstr ""
"不新增第二个 Flash owner、运行期 registry、heap、强制 OS 锁、隐藏 worker "
"或自动喂狗。应用任务、升级策略、分区、认证和复位策略仍由外部仓库负责。"

msgid ""
"The [public Flash contract](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/io/include/nexus/io/flash.h) requires one execution "
"owner and no concurrent program/erase calls. The external caller owns that "
"scheduling; an active-state check does not provide a hidden concurrent lock."
msgstr ""
"[公共 Flash 合同](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/io/include/nexus/io/flash.h)要求单一执行 owner，且不得并发调用 "
"program/erase。调度由外部调用者负责；active 状态检查不构成隐藏的并发锁。"

msgid "Prepare bytes and context before making Flash busy"
msgstr "在 Flash 进入忙状态前准备字节与上下文"

msgid ""
"Cold preparation must validate the selected load/run ranges, copy the "
"audited code/literals into admitted AXI SRAM and verify the resulting layout"
" before publishing readiness. Private vectors, stack, command, deadline "
"operands, workspace and terminal diagnostics must remain in admitted RAM "
"throughout the busy interval. Selected RAM cannot overlap submitted buffers,"
" executable/load bytes, vectors, control MMIO, current System state or other"
" private metadata. Half-open range checks must reject overflow and partial "
"aliases before access."
msgstr ""
"冷态准备必须校验选定 LOAD/RUN 范围，将已审查代码／literal 复制到准入的 AXI "
"SRAM，并在发布就绪前核验实际布局。整个忙区间内，私有向量、栈、命令、deadline 操作数、工作区与终止诊断都必须留在准入 RAM。选定 RAM "
"不得与提交缓冲区、可执行／LOAD 字节、向量、控制 MMIO、当前 System "
"状态或其他私有元数据重叠。半开区间检查必须先于访问拒绝溢出与部分别名。"

msgid ""
"The final call must re-observe actual privileged Thread context, masks, "
"Cache state and floating-point state; successful cold preparation alone does"
" not prove the later call context. Entry requires PRIMASK, BASEPRI and "
"FAULTMASK to be zero; an IRQ call or live lazy FP context is inadmissible. "
"The deadline must be finite in the current System TIM2 domain; "
"`NX_DEADLINE_NEVER` is unsupported. The bridge must preserve distinct MSP "
"and PSP, CONTROL including FPCA, and incoming PRIMASK. The assembly bridge "
"changes only CPU stack/mask state: it establishes the private MSP and calls "
"the RAM transaction. That transaction publishes and reads back RAM VTOR "
"before the MPU guard can become active. After actual drain and protection "
"restoration it restores and reads back VTOR; only then can the bridge "
"restore the caller's exact CPU state. Every transitional NMI/HardFault path "
"and exception frame must have a proved owner and sufficient actual stack "
"reserve."
msgstr ""
"最终调用必须重新观测实际特权 Thread 上下文、mask、Cache 和浮点状态；冷态准备成功不能单独证明后续调用上下文。入口要求 "
"PRIMASK、BASEPRI 和 FAULTMASK 均为零；IRQ 调用或活动 lazy FP 上下文不得准入。deadline 必须是当前 "
"System TIM2 域中的有限值，不支持 `NX_DEADLINE_NEVER`。bridge 必须分别保存 MSP、PSP、包含 FPCA 的 "
"CONTROL 及传入 PRIMASK。汇编 bridge 仅修改 CPU 栈／mask 状态：建立私有 MSP 后调用 RAM 事务。该事务在 MPU"
" guard 生效前发布并读回 RAM VTOR；实际排空并恢复保护后，它恢复并读回 VTOR，随后 bridge 才能精确恢复调用者 CPU "
"状态。每个过渡期 NMI/HardFault 路径与异常帧都必须具有已证明的 owner 和充足实际栈预留。"

msgid ""
"The source/ELF closure must include actual instructions, veneers, literals, "
"direct and indirect calls, handlers, terminal paths and compiler-generated "
"helpers. A section name, C attribute, caller-authored `ram_safe` flag or "
"unused matching literal is insufficient. Firmware remains C11; test "
"machinery does not become a firmware dependency."
msgstr ""
"源码／ELF 闭包必须覆盖实际指令、veneer、literal、直接与间接调用、handler、终止路径以及编译器生成的 helper。section"
" 名、C attribute、调用者自称的 `ram_safe` 标志或未使用的匹配 literal 均不足为证。固件保持 "
"C11；测试机制不进入固件依赖。"

msgid "Protect the CPU from Code-domain speculation"
msgstr "阻止 CPU 对 Code 域的推测访问"

msgid ""
"Cache-off is necessary for this reference, but it is not a branch-predictor-"
"off proof. PM0253 Rev6 describes speculative Normal-memory and branch-target"
" reads; CCR.BP is read-only and always one, and BPIALL is not implemented. "
"DSB completes prior explicit accesses; it does not disable later prediction."
" AN4838 Rev11 section 3.4 recommends using MPU memory attributes to prevent "
"speculative prefetch. The target therefore combines the audited explicit-"
"access closure with a temporary Code-domain memory-type guard."
msgstr ""
"此参考配置必须关闭 Cache，但这不证明分支预测已关闭。PM0253 Rev6 说明了对 Normal memory "
"和分支目标的推测读取；CCR.BP 只读且恒为一，BPIALL 未实现。DSB 完成之前的显式访问，不会禁用之后的预测。AN4838 Rev11 第 "
"3.4 节建议通过 MPU 内存属性阻止推测预取。因此目标设计将独立审查的显式访问闭包与临时 Code 域内存类型 guard 结合。"

msgid ""
"The first admitted implementation requires the actual unified 16-region MPU."
" An enabled incoming MPU, unsupported TYPE, or HFNMIENA without ENABLE is "
"rejected. Disabled CTRL values 0 and 4 are preserved exactly. **CTRL=0 does "
"not prove that all descriptors are disabled:** all 16 RASR.EN values must be"
" observed. An enabled foreign descriptor is rejected before policy writes. "
"Scanning RNR is itself an owned selector effect and must be rolled back on "
"every returning path; a refused rollback retains responsibility in RAM."
msgstr ""
"首个准入实现要求实际统一 16-region MPU。传入 MPU 已启用、TYPE 不支持，或未 ENABLE 却设置 HFNMIENA "
"时均拒绝。禁用 CTRL 值 0 与 4 必须精确保留。 **CTRL=0 不能证明所有描述符都已禁用：**必须观测全部 16 个 "
"RASR.EN。存在启用的外来描述符时，必须在写入策略前拒绝。扫描 RNR 本身就是已取得的 selector "
"效果，每条返回路径都必须回退；若回退被拒绝，责任保留在 RAM。"

msgid "Selected region 15 field"
msgstr "选定 region 15 字段"

msgid "Target value"
msgstr "目标值"

msgid "Base and half-open extent"
msgstr "基址与半开范围"

msgid "0; `[0, 0x20000000)`"
msgstr "0；`[0, 0x20000000)`"

msgid "SIZE / SRD / ENABLE"
msgstr "SIZE / SRD / ENABLE"

msgid "28 / 0 / 1: 512 MiB, every subregion enabled"
msgstr "28 / 0 / 1：512 MiB，全部子区域启用"

msgid "XN / AP"
msgstr "XN / AP"

msgid "1 / 001: no instructions; privileged read/write"
msgstr "1 / 001：禁止取指；特权读写"

msgid "TEX / C / B / S"
msgstr "TEX / C / B / S"

msgid "0 / 0 / 0 / 0: Strongly-ordered, implicitly shared"
msgstr "0 / 0 / 0 / 0：Strongly-ordered，隐式共享"

msgid "RASR"
msgstr "RASR"

msgid "`0x11000039`"
msgstr "`0x11000039`"

msgid "CTRL"
msgstr "CTRL"

msgid "7: ENABLE, PRIVDEFENA and HFNMIENA"
msgstr "7：ENABLE、PRIVDEFENA 和 HFNMIENA"

msgid ""
"XN prohibits Code-domain instruction fetch; Strongly-ordered replaces the "
"Normal memory type that permits speculative reads. AP001 permits the eight "
"explicit CPU stores needed to program one 32-byte flashword. AP000 would "
"prevent those stores and is therefore unsuitable for the unified "
"program/erase path. AP001 also permits explicit reads: the independently "
"audited RAM graph must exclude them. This is not a blanket no-bus-access "
"permission check."
msgstr ""
"XN 禁止 Code 域取指；Strongly-ordered 替换允许推测读取的 Normal memory 类型。 AP001 允许编程一个 "
"32-byte flashword 所需的八次显式 CPU store。AP000 会阻止这些 store，因此不适用于统一的编程／擦除路径。AP001"
" 也允许显式读取：独立审查的 RAM 调用图必须排除这些读取。这不是一项全面禁止总线访问的权限检查。"

msgid ""
"The owner saves the exact incoming CTRL, RNR and selected RBAR/RASR before "
"their first possible effect. RBAR readback includes the selected region "
"number; the base field must be checked according to the real register "
"semantics. Disabled descriptor fields need not be zero and must survive "
"restoration. Readback and DSB/ISB must prove region/control installation "
"before any program store or erase START. The policy remains active in "
"NMI/HardFault through HFNMIENA. No ordinary Flash-resident Arch or vendor "
"MPU helper may be called during this window."
msgstr ""
"owner 必须在首次可能产生效果前，精确保存传入 CTRL、RNR 与选定 RBAR/RASR。 RBAR 读回包含选定 region "
"编号；基址字段必须按实际寄存器语义核验。禁用描述符的字段不要求为零，恢复时也必须保留。在任何编程 store 或擦除 START 前，读回与 "
"DSB/ISB 必须证明 region/control 已安装。HFNMIENA 使策略在 NMI/HardFault "
"中保持生效。在此窗口内不得调用驻留普通 Flash 的 Arch 或厂商 MPU helper。"

msgid "A deadline expires; a physical pulse does not cancel"
msgstr "deadline 到期不能取消物理脉冲"

msgid ""
"![FIG-18 target: deadline expiry latches a result while the RAM transaction "
"retains protection, waits for actual both-bank drain and restores state "
"before return](../assets/diagrams/h743-flash-ram-lifecycle.svg)"
msgstr ""
"![FIG-18 target：deadline 到期只锁存结果；RAM 事务保留保护，等待真实双 Bank "
"排空并恢复状态后才能返回](../assets/diagrams/h743-flash-ram-lifecycle.svg)"

msgid ""
"FIG-18 target: deadline expiry latches a result while the RAM transaction "
"retains protection, waits for actual both-bank drain and restores state "
"before return"
msgstr "FIG-18 target：deadline 到期只锁存结果；RAM 事务保留保护，等待真实双 Bank 排空并恢复状态后才能返回"

msgid ""
"FIG-18 shows protocol stages, not a new public request enum. Every arrow is "
"a guarded control-flow transition. The returning path requires the following"
" sequence; the terminal path has no edge back to ordinary code."
msgstr ""
"FIG-18 表示协议阶段，不新增公共 request "
"enum。每条箭头都是具有条件的控制流迁移。返回路径必须满足以下顺序；终止路径没有返回普通代码的边。"

msgid ""
"Reject invalid input or a deadline already expired before trigger. If any "
"pre-trigger temporary selector/protection effect was acquired, prove "
"rollback while both banks are idle. Every returning RAM path, including "
"rejected vector publication and pre-trigger guard/deadline refusal, must "
"pass the common RAM return gate: both banks idle, zero retained guard "
"effects and the exact saved target control plus LOCK proved. Lock the idle "
"target if necessary before restoring VTOR; an unproved condition enters RAM "
"fail-stop."
msgstr ""
"在触发前拒绝无效输入或已到期 deadline。若已取得触发前临时 selector／保护效果，必须在双 Bank 均空闲时证明回退。每条返回的 RAM"
" 路径，包括向量发布拒绝和触发前 guard／deadline 拒绝，都必须通过共同 RAM 返回门：双 Bank 空闲、guard "
"无保留效果，以及完整保存的目标控制值与 LOCK 已证明。必要时先锁定空闲目标，再恢复 VTOR；无法证明条件成立时进入 RAM fail-stop。"

msgid ""
"Stage a validated command and input, enter the RAM bridge, install RAM "
"vectors and prove the MPU guard before starting the physical operation."
msgstr "暂存已校验命令与输入，进入 RAM bridge，安装 RAM 向量，并在启动物理操作前证明 MPU guard。"

msgid ""
"Perform only the explicit validated program stores or erase START. Observe "
"real BSY/QW/WBNE for both banks and retain all command/workspace ownership."
msgstr "只执行已明确校验的编程 store 或擦除 START。观测两个 Bank 的真实 BSY/QW/WBNE，保留全部命令／工作区所有权。"

msgid ""
"If the absolute deadline expires after trigger, latch `TIMEOUT` and continue"
" actual RAM polling. Do not clear busy bits, withdraw protection, release "
"storage or jump to a Flash error handler to manufacture settlement."
msgstr ""
"触发后绝对 deadline 到期时，锁存 `TIMEOUT` 并继续真实 RAM 轮询。不得清除 busy 位、撤回保护、释放存储，或跳到 Flash"
" 错误 handler 制造已结清假象。"

msgid ""
"After both banks are actually idle, prove target LOCK, complete the required"
" barrier and restore/read back MPU state. The RAM transaction must pass the "
"same common return gate used for pre-trigger refusals, then restore/read "
"back VTOR before the CPU bridge restores the exact caller context and "
"returns to ordinary code."
msgstr ""
"双 Bank 实际空闲后，证明目标 LOCK，完成所需屏障并恢复／读回 MPU 状态。RAM 事务必须通过与触发前拒绝相同的共同返回门，再恢复／读回 "
"VTOR；随后 CPU bridge 才能精确恢复调用者上下文并返回普通代码。"

msgid ""
"Report the settled result. Hardware failure reports `IO`; otherwise a "
"latched expiry reports `TIMEOUT`, and successful completion reports "
"`SUCCESS`."
msgstr "报告已结清结果。硬件失败报告 `IO`；否则已锁存到期报告 `TIMEOUT`，成功完成报告 `SUCCESS`。"

msgid ""
"Permanently busy hardware never reaches the returning path. It remains in "
"the RAM drain path with protection and storage retained. Unprovable lock, "
"protection, vector or time-domain state likewise takes a nonreturning RAM "
"fail-stop path. The CPU-only bridge has no invented runtime readback or "
"failure dispatcher: its exact restoration must be proved against the actual "
"ARM instructions and admitted incoming context before software exit. A host "
"watchdog may observe and terminate its isolated test process; that is not "
"device drain or product recovery. This design promises no hidden reset, "
"watchdog service, RTOS progress or bounded wall-time return."
msgstr ""
"硬件永久 busy 时永远不能进入返回路径，必须留在 RAM 排空路径并保留保护与存储。无法证明 lock、保护、向量或时间域状态时，同样进入不返回的 "
"RAM fail-stop 路径。仅负责 CPU 的 bridge 没有虚构的运行时读回或错误分派；必须在软件退出前，结合实际 ARM "
"指令和已准入传入上下文证明其精确恢复。host watchdog "
"可以观测并终止隔离的测试进程，但这不是设备排空或产品恢复。该设计不承诺隐藏复位、喂狗、RTOS 进度或有界墙钟返回时间。"

msgid ""
"The selected deadline uses the existing TIM2 domain and epoch. Any wrap "
"extension must have an actual supported service/pulse bound; one pending UIF"
" cannot count an arbitrary number of masked wraps. A lost or exhausted epoch"
" cannot resume deadline consumers with a plausible zero. RTOS/SysTick "
"compensation and product time recovery require their own reviewed contract. "
"Long masked Flash maintenance does not inherit the short Arch critical-"
"section latency contract."
msgstr ""
"选定 deadline 使用既有 TIM2 时间域与 epoch。任何回绕扩展都必须具有实际可支持的 service／pulse 上界；单个待处理 "
"UIF 不能计数屏蔽期间任意多次回绕。丢失或耗尽的 epoch 不能以貌似合理的零继续向 deadline consumer "
"提供时间。RTOS/SysTick 补偿和产品时间恢复需要各自审查的合同。长时间屏蔽中断的 Flash 维护不能继承 Arch 短临界区的延迟合同。"

msgid "CPU protection does not quiesce the system"
msgstr "CPU 保护不能替代系统静止"

msgid ""
"This MPU guard constrains the CPU. It neither stops DMA1/2, MDMA, Ethernet, "
"USB, display engines and debug access nor joins their late IRQ or "
"publication paths. Before calling maintenance, the external owner must "
"withdraw and join every master that can access the busy Flash domain, "
"including descriptors and input sources, or supply an independently proved "
"disjoint plan. Address ranges alone do not prove that a worker or bus master"
" has stopped."
msgstr ""
"该 MPU guard 约束 CPU，不会停止 DMA1/2、MDMA、Ethernet、USB、显示引擎和调试访问，也不会 join 它们迟到的 "
"IRQ 或 publication 路径。调用维护前，外部 owner 必须撤回并 join 每个能访问忙 Flash 域的 "
"master，包括描述符与输入源；或者提供独立证明的互不干扰计划。地址范围本身不能证明 worker 或总线 master 已停止。"

msgid ""
"The same caller must choose how its product tolerates masked interrupts, "
"watchdog expiry, power failure and a nonreturning fault. The platform does "
"not select these policies or infer them from a Board reference. This design "
"does not admit Cache-on programming, enabled foreign MPU regions, bank swap,"
" option/OTP writes, every H7 cut, bootloader adoption or runtime clock "
"changes."
msgstr ""
"同一调用者还必须决定产品如何容忍中断屏蔽、看门狗到期、掉电和不返回故障。平台不选择这些策略，也不根据 Board 参考推断策略。本设计不准入 "
"Cache-on 编程、已启用的外来 MPU region、bank swap、option/OTP 写入、所有 H7 cut、bootloader "
"接管或运行期时钟变化。"

msgid "Keep cost and evidence tied to the actual bytes"
msgstr "将成本与证据绑定实际字节"

msgid ""
"Selected-only source and instance generation must keep unselected images "
"free of the RAM pod, workspace and calls. Actual selected/unselected ELF "
"comparison must separately report Flash LOAD/footprint, copied executable "
"bytes, static RAM, alignment padding and the real call/exception stack "
"requirement. An array size or host `sizeof` is not linked cost, measured "
"stack use, throughput or WCET. This page makes no measured cost, stack high-"
"water, throughput or WCET claim."
msgstr ""
"按选择生成 source 与实例时，未选入镜像不得含 RAM 执行区、工作区或调用。实际 selected/unselected ELF "
"比较必须分别报告 Flash LOAD／footprint、复制的可执行字节、静态 RAM、对齐填充，以及实际调用／异常栈需求。数组大小或 host "
"`sizeof` 不是链接成本、实测栈使用、吞吐量或 WCET。本页不声明测得成本、栈高水位、吞吐量或 WCET。"

msgid "Evidence required before software exit"
msgstr "软件退出前所需证据"

msgid "Boundary"
msgstr "边界"

msgid "Real GoogleTest/GoogleMock RED then GREEN"
msgstr "真实 GoogleTest/GoogleMock RED 后 GREEN"

msgid ""
"Actual provider/bridge boundary, failures, late drain and instance "
"isolation; no mock implementation"
msgstr "实际 provider／bridge 边界、失败、迟到排空和实例隔离；不 mock 实现"

msgid "Normal TOML/generated lifecycle and factory tests"
msgstr "正常 TOML／生成生命周期与 factory 测试"

msgid ""
"One authored assembly, immutable IR, real selected-only constructor and "
"retained cleanup"
msgstr "单份 authored 装配、不可变 IR、实际按需 constructor 与保留清理"

msgid "Actual emitted ARM firmware and closure report"
msgstr "实际发出的 ARM 固件与闭包报告"

msgid ""
"Copied bytes, decoded calls/literals/register flow, guard values, no "
"premature return, vectors/stack/time and image/control aliases"
msgstr "复制字节、解码调用／literal／寄存器流、guard 值、不提前返回、向量／栈／时间与镜像／控制别名"

msgid "Selected and unselected ARM resource checks"
msgstr "选入与未选入 ARM 资源检查"

msgid "Exact emitted source graph, retention and separate RAM/Flash costs"
msgstr "精确生成 source graph、retention 与分别统计的 RAM／Flash 成本"

msgid "Clean SDK, full gates and candidate evidence"
msgstr "clean SDK、完整 gates 与候选证据"

msgid ""
"Exact source/configuration/dependencies/tools; no reuse of older commit "
"results"
msgstr "精确 source／配置／依赖／工具；不复用旧 commit 结果"

msgid "Physical station execution"
msgstr "实际 station 执行"

msgid ""
"Real silicon/PCB/electrical conditions, speculative traffic, pulse timing, "
"power loss, watchdog and interrupt behavior"
msgstr "真实 silicon／PCB／电气条件、推测流量、脉冲时序、掉电、看门狗和中断行为"

msgid ""
"Synthetic checker fixtures establish only their checker behavior. Host "
"register models do not measure the real branch predictor, bus contention or "
"IRQ latency. If the checker cannot prove part of the production control "
"flow, the missing proof remains an open exit. The {download}`IO-01–42 ledger"
" <io-evolution-execution.csv>` remains the implementation-status authority; "
"actual execution counts and source identities belong in delivery evidence "
"rather than this design contract."
msgstr ""
"合成 checker fixture 只能证明 checker 本身行为。host 寄存器模型不能测量实际分支预测器、总线竞争或 IRQ 延迟。如果 "
"checker 无法证明生产控制流中的某部分，缺失证明仍是未关闭退出条件。{download}`IO-01–42 台账 <io-evolution-"
"execution.csv>`继续作为实现状态权威；实际执行计数与 source 身份应进入交付证据，而不是本设计合同。"

msgid ""
"The implementation is split between [cold preparation and "
"admission](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/stm32h743/drivers/flash_ram_owner.c), the [CPU-only "
"bridge](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/stm32h743/drivers/flash_ram_enter.S), [RAM vector "
"publication](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/stm32h743/drivers/flash_ram_transaction.c), the [MPU "
"transaction](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/stm32h743/drivers/flash_mpu.c) and [physical pulse/time "
"observations](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/stm32h743/drivers/flash_ram.c). Their private workspace and "
"checked C/assembly prefix are declared in [the RAM "
"contract](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/stm32h743/private/stm32h743_flash_ram.h). These links locate "
"current work; they do not substitute for the required execution and "
"production-ELF evidence."
msgstr ""
"实现分为[冷态准备与准入](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/stm32h743/drivers/flash_ram_owner.c)、[仅负责 CPU 的 "
"bridge](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/stm32h743/drivers/flash_ram_enter.S)、[RAM "
"向量发布](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/stm32h743/drivers/flash_ram_transaction.c)、[MPU "
"事务](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/stm32h743/drivers/flash_mpu.c)和[物理脉冲／时间观测](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/stm32h743/drivers/flash_ram.c)。私有工作区与已核对的 C／汇编前缀在[RAM "
"合同](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/stm32h743/private/stm32h743_flash_ram.h)中声明。这些链接用于定位当前工作，不能替代所需执行和生产"
" ELF 证据。"

msgid ""
"Primary references are PM0253 Rev6 sections 2.3 and 4.6–4.8, AN4838 Rev11 "
"section 3.4, RM0433 Rev9's Flash maps/read-while-write rules and ES0392 "
"Rev15 section 2.1.2. The source-identity record and selected provider "
"evidence must accompany the implementation review. See also the [H743 "
"provider scope](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/stm32h743/README.md), [V-only clock contract](h743-high-"
"clock.md), [I/O evolution](io-evolution.md), [Arch contract](arch-"
"contracts.md) and [qualification boundary](../delivery/qualification.md)."
msgstr ""
"主要参考为 PM0253 Rev6 第 2.3、4.6–4.8 节，AN4838 Rev11 第 3.4 节、RM0433 Rev9 的 Flash "
"映射／read-while-write 规则，以及 ES0392 Rev15 第 2.1.2 节。实现评审必须附 source 身份记录和选定 "
"provider 证据。另见 [H743 provider 范围](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32h743/README.md)、 [V-only "
"时钟合同](h743-high-clock.md)、[I/O 增量架构](io-evolution.md)、 [Arch 合同](arch-"
"contracts.md)与[资格边界](../delivery/qualification.md)。"

msgid ""
"Public reads, the program path's erased-region precheck and every programmed"
" flashword readback inspect the current `SNECCERR`/`DBECCERR` sticky flags "
"in both banks. An observed flag reports `IO`; these physical-data read "
"checks do not acknowledge it with W1C. This includes events already latched "
"on entry: the status cannot identify their source or establish recovery from"
" a DBECC exception. Corrected data may compare equal, so an observed event "
"must be reported before an all-FF input no-op or a subsequent pulse can hide"
" it. This does not remove the separate target-bank W1C phase in erase/pulse "
"preparation."
msgstr ""
"公共 read、program 路径的已擦除区域预检，以及每个已编程 flashword 的读回，都会检查双 Bank 当前的 "
"`SNECCERR`/`DBECCERR` sticky 标志。观察到标志时返回 `IO`；这些物理数据读检查自身不会通过 W1C "
"清除标志。这也包括入口处已经锁存的事件：状态不能确定其来源，也不能证明 DBECC "
"异常已恢复。纠正后的数据仍可能比较相等，因此必须先报告已观察事件，不能让全 FF 输入的无操作路径或后续脉冲将其掩盖。这不会取消 "
"erase／脉冲准备中独立的目标 Bank W1C 阶段。"

#: ../../nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/h743-flash-ram.md:102
msgid ""
"The normal firmware link for a selected H743 Flash assembly now invokes the "
"automatic RAM audit. It checks the complete copied pod and workspace against"
" the actual ELF sections and LOAD segments: the RX run range has one "
"matching Flash load range, their bytes agree, and the vector, stack and "
"workspace extents are disjoint from the pod and wholly in writable RAM. The "
"immutable Flash image guard must contain the actual linked endpoints and "
"cover every file-backed LOAD. These checks are part of the normal link, "
"rather than only synthetic checker fixtures. Changing a guard byte in a real"
" firmware ELF is rejected by the same audit."
msgstr ""
"选定 H743 Flash 装配的正常固件链接现在执行自动 RAM 审计。审计针对真实 ELF section 和 LOAD segment "
"校验完整复制 pod 与 workspace：RX run range 有唯一匹配的 Flash load "
"range，字节一致；vector、stack 和 workspace extent 与 pod 互不重叠，并完全位于可写 RAM。不可变 Flash "
"image guard 必须包含真实链接端点，并覆盖每个带文件内容的 LOAD。这些检查属于正常链接流程，而不只是合成 checker "
"fixture。修改真实固件 ELF 的 guard 字节会被同一审计拒绝。"

#: ../../nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/h743-flash-ram.md:111
msgid ""
"The audit also checks the actual CPU-bridge instructions, RAM direct "
"control-flow and literal residency, and a conservative private-stack bound "
"based on emitted compiler `.su` frame records and exception reserve. Its "
"layout report separates copied bytes, workspace bytes and their combined "
"static RAM extent; alignment outside those extents remains part of the "
"ordinary image resource report. These checks retain explicit C/ABI "
"preconditions; arbitrary C data-pointer access, MMIO effects and MPU/drain "
"ordering still require provider models and source review. They establish "
"neither a complete formal execution-closure proof nor measured stack, timing"
" or physical behavior."
msgstr ""
"审计还检查真实 CPU bridge 指令、RAM 直接控制流和 literal 驻留，并根据编译器生成的 `.su` frame 记录与 "
"exception reserve 给出保守私有栈上界。layout 报告分别列出复制字节、workspace 字节及两者合计的静态 RAM "
"extent；这些 extent 以外的对齐空间仍由普通镜像资源报告计入。检查保留显式 C/ABI 前提；任意 C data pointer "
"访问、MMIO 效果以及 MPU/drain 顺序仍需 provider 模型和源码审查。结果既不建立完整形式化执行闭包证明，也不代表实测 "
"stack、timing 或物理行为。"
